    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτο-κτόνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>self-slaying,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεὶρ αὐ.,</span> of Medea, <i>who slew
				her own children,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1254
			</span></i> (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				<i>with one's own hand,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1635
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slaying one another,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					810
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάνατος αὐ.</span>
			<i>mutual</i> death <i>by each other's hand,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				681
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρα αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.152
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Leont.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					734
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
